        body: "The before ad is all snap and no shine: no new information, no evidence, and nothing that makes you believe they mean it. The after ad gives a new detail (photos of *your* roof), built-in proof (the address), and conviction (the 'if we can't show it' rule). Replace the bracket with the client's real number, or cut it."
