        body: "That fixes all six mistakes. No more expiring-promo dependency (#1), concentrated frequency (#2), an outsider's view (#3), proof in each ad (#4), intrusive and passive split by job (#5), and a campaign of single-point ads (#6). The budget numbers are illustrative. Use PMT's actual spend."
