          model: "ZDub features:\n1. Call tracking, which means every call is tied to the ad that caused it, which means you know which ads pay, which means you stop arguing about whether marketing works.\n2. A 5-minute speed-to-lead auto-text, which means homeowners hear from you before they call the next roofer, which means more of the leads you already pay for become jobs.\n3. Monthly creative refresh, which means your ads don't go stale, which means your cost per lead doesn't creep up every month.\n4. One fixed monthly fee, which means no surprise invoices, which means you can budget like a grown business.\n5. Local-only targeting radius, which means you don't pay for clicks from people you'll never serve, which means every dollar is spent on your actual neighbors."
